{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0374_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3b46bedb7b85e87bfb57979d640d45315d6896cdc7c81dccf6726c27ea90f2b5", "ja": "（CMの撮影で、ひなたとまつりが巨大なスイーツを\n作った。ふたりの楽しそうな顔が印象的だったな……）", "zh": "（拍摄广告时，日向和茉莉做了巨大的甜点。她们两人脸上开心的表情给我留下了深刻印象……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0374_1001_035hin", "source_sha256": "c91f97f7f54d6716a031245729fb2b8dcc443c12a6fabb8b0fb67e9071e51571", "ja": "まつり姫さんも知らないのかい？\nうーん……やっぱり{$P$}に……。", "zh": "连茉莉公主也不知道吗？\n嗯……果然还是得问问{$P$}……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0374_1002_p", "source_sha256": "eb2eaa41fee08aa2212075d8c09d01bbf75bf89c006e682013d4d1ba078b1ee4", "ja": "ひなた、まつり……。今、呼んだか？", "zh": "ひなた、まつり……刚才是你们叫我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0374_1003_021mat", "source_sha256": "66028d7f7d96b2544647dda1387ddbea07bca9a6d7ab5a263e7c8c39bd8787b2", "ja": "{$P$}さん！　ちょうどいいところに\n来たのです！　姫たち、とっても困っているのです！", "zh": "{$P$}先生！　你来得\n正好呢！公主我们遇到了好大的麻烦哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0374_1004_p", "source_sha256": "02b34bc3df8692634fcd61bba52b1d7ef711ac874cdb634bcb1fa835e7b36784", "ja": "そ、そうか……。\nそれで困ってるって、何があったんだ？", "zh": "这、这样啊……\n所以你说遇到麻烦了，到底发生什么事了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0374_1005_035hin", "source_sha256": "69ce2d16c59ff22007cb6221f2edab9028ba2801c11d98f38e00e4523119d998", "ja": "うん……。さっきの撮影で作った、おっきなスイーツ。\nこのあと、どうなるのか気になってねぇ。", "zh": "嗯……刚才拍摄时做的大甜点，\n我很在意之后会怎么处理呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0374_1006_021mat", "source_sha256": "48035ef6407059f35af9c5b0c4a2c3c6e1f468eabc527a974698f386d47e973b", "ja": "スタッフさんに聞いたら、\n「大きすぎて運ぶのは難しい」って言われたのです。", "zh": "我问了工作人员，他们说：“太大了，很难搬运。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0374_1007_035hin", "source_sha256": "0e0c1b4d4a1a65821e9d675cb690dabc0d65b339e7fd62948427b04238d2acf3", "ja": "あたしたちで食べられる大きさならいいんだけども\n……。食べ終わるまでに何日もかかってしまうねぇ。", "zh": "要是大小适合我们吃就好了，可是……吃完得花上好几天呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0374_1008_035hin", "source_sha256": "9d4ba77ad2d3bf9fd751341bc5faf1a9c3b6aad30e70358247a5a4fb94453060", "ja": "だからって、あのまま捨ててしまうのも、\nかわいそうだし……。どうすればいいんだろか？", "zh": "可是，就那样直接扔掉也太可怜了……该怎么办才好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0374_1009_p", "source_sha256": "b2e6f6587fd8fe5f92d0411373fd075e29526ad83d9ef1ec3971d73088362753", "ja": "そうだな……。ふたりが頑張って作ったケーキだ。\n確かに気になるな……。", "zh": "是啊……那可是两个人努力做出来的蛋糕。\n确实让人在意啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0374_1010_035hin", "source_sha256": "f03e590bfd1e08f904ecbebc6de175795f8115b1b7b096c06248e4c1c879c9ed", "ja": "スイーツに使った果物も、おいしそうに育ったのに、\n誰にも食べてもらえないなんて……。", "zh": "就连用在甜点里的水果，也都长得那么好吃，却没能让任何人品尝……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0374_1011_p", "source_sha256": "9396f8fffbbd220a8d9d04be01c4150e10d71332a45c6ab40b4dfd1bcac9ffb9", "ja": "ひなた……。", "zh": "日向……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0374_1012_021mat", "source_sha256": "a15d03c69335b21c4a45f0085374fa1dbca6719ec5b1eb750c1062ebc8aa73af", "ja": "むむっ……。姫たちだけで食べ切れないなら、\n食べる人を増やせばいいのでは……？", "zh": "唔唔……既然单凭公主我们吃不完，\n那增加一起吃的人不就好了吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0374_1013_p", "source_sha256": "e1d825864acb2300c0f937c5827cd59ff49c1297974d53460879691abbce3e42", "ja": "ん？", "zh": "嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0374_1014_021mat", "source_sha256": "0ac76b5c78ffbaed11b1d931a76a51eec73a90da23f721251123a26c007538fd", "ja": "ひなたちゃん♪　きっと{$P$}さんが\nなんとかしてくれるのです！", "zh": "日向♪　{$P$}先生一定会想办法的哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0374_1015_p", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0374_1016_035hin", "source_sha256": "f441c0bc143ccfb2deadb3a561012884ca5c12730e152fe5b230de3dc2048d02", "ja": "本当かい、まつり姫さん？\n{$P$}、何かいい案があるのかい？", "zh": "真的吗，茉莉公主？\n{$P$}，你有什么好主意吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0374_1017_p", "source_sha256": "5090141fea58737f29309512c1e52ba8d3c6b68a4ae43839612eedf88aaae230", "ja": "ええっ！？　いや、俺は……。", "zh": "欸！？不，我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0374_1018_021mat", "source_sha256": "b583621937ded3e95219f6b4ea592b875fcdc4bb48d2132abac28f0e69ca87cc", "ja": "大丈夫なのですよ、{$P$}さん。\nこの撮影所には、たくさんの人が働いているのです。", "zh": "没关系的哦，{$P$}先生。\n这个片场里有很多人在工作呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0374_1019_021mat", "source_sha256": "d650d59f98c75ac1f6bde41b2b834a099d20ba36ccff8b72a5ae5859a7c7acb3", "ja": "きっとみんな、お腹がペコペコで\n姫たちのスイーツを待っているはずなのです♪", "zh": "大家肯定都饿得肚子咕咕叫，正等着公主们的甜点呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0374_1020_p", "source_sha256": "ab2742ae8fba28e23a4a2b84162cba8899489702c34328a0ab7931d3623d3e62", "ja": "ああ……なるほど！　そうだな。撮影所の\nスタッフさんたちに、スイーツをおすそ分けしよう！", "zh": "啊……原来如此！确实应该这样。把甜点分给摄影棚的工作人员吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0374_1021_p", "source_sha256": "dff750f42e05f1a696e727b8103b66bef9b45469fbb7f82cc2359e6e919b65bf", "ja": "スイーツも果物も、\n新鮮なうちに食べた方がいいからな。", "zh": "甜点和水果，还是趁新鲜吃比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0374_1022_035hin", "source_sha256": "98e54904f3cf9e7f4e20610967c98fa7978581f85df2f8023efbe5b8f72eb5f0", "ja": "わぁ、それはいいねぇ。\nたくさんの人と一緒に食べたら、あたしも嬉しいべさ。", "zh": "哇，那可真不错呢。\n要是能跟好多人一起吃的话，我也很高兴呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0374_1023_021mat", "source_sha256": "ce089296227b33d751414c0a7cc5bfcc2b993a48be08897743b1977cf4d962a9", "ja": "姫も同じ気持ちなのです。ひなたちゃんと姫による\nひなまつりパーティーですね♪", "zh": "公主也是这么想的哦。由日向和公主举办的\n雏祭派对呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0374_1024_035hin", "source_sha256": "ffba0aab17c227f77649d4e73386c549846dcb7d423ea4d1d3f3098638584701", "ja": "パーティー……。とっても楽しそうな名前だねぇ。\nそれじゃさっそく、準備をはじめないと！　えへへ♪", "zh": "派对……听起来就是个特别开心的名字呢。\n那就得马上开始准备了！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0374_1025_p", "source_sha256": "c3ce83a132e8ce5acf9d4c980a7fcb510a44c5eae077c6faebda7d1105ee8c1e", "ja": "（まつりのお陰で、ひなたに笑顔が戻ってよかった。\nおっと……俺もパーティーの準備を手伝わないと！）", "zh": "（多亏了茉莉，日向终于又露出了笑容，真是太好了。\n等等……我也得去帮忙准备派对才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
